    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">The Reporting Person forfeited 13,298 shares of common stock upon conversion of an aggregate 43,816 vested and outstanding restricted stock units into shares of common stock to cover tax withholdings, using the market price of the issuer's common stock at the time of forfeiture. These restricted stock units were part of the grant reported in Table I of the Form 4 filed by the Reporting Person with the Securities and Exchange Commission on February 7, 2025.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">Includes 426,219 unvested restricted stock units held by the Reporting Person, all of which remain subject to certain vesting conditions.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">The Reporting Person forfeited 6,650 shares of common stock upon conversion of an aggregate 21,908 vested and outstanding restricted stock units into shares of common stock to cover tax withholdings, using the market price of the issuer's common stock at the time of forfeiture. These restricted stock units were part of the grant reported in Table I of the Form 4 filed by the Reporting Person with the Securities and Exchange Commission on July 1, 2024.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F4">Includes 404,311 unvested restricted stock units held by the Reporting Person, all of which remain subject to certain vesting conditions.</footnote>
